# Force the Python builder to install from requirements.txt (the lean serverless
# dep set). With pyproject.toml present, uv installs its base deps instead —
# which pulls chromadb (size cap) and MISSES the [live] extras (openai, requests,
# pinecone, supabase) the deployed function needs.
pyproject.toml
